    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that. but it feels like everyone is just being nice because they have to be. if i'm being totally honest, it doesn't feel like a \"dark thought.\" it feels like the only honest thing i've thought in years. like, if i'm truly a net negative to everyone i love, isn't the most compassionate thing to just... stop being a burden?",
